(About Abha) Tj
0 -17 Td
(Abha is a city in the Asir region in the south west of Saudi Arabia.) Tj
0 -17 Td
(It is high in the mountains, about 2,200 meters, so the weather is cool.) Tj
0 -17 Td
(In summer many families come from hot cities because it is nice and green.) Tj
0 -17 Td
(There is a lot of fog and clouds, sometimes the clouds are under you.) Tj
0 -17 Td
(In spring the jacaranda trees are purple in the streets. Very beautiful.) Tj
0 -17 Td
() Tj
0 -17 Td
(Best time to visit) Tj
0 -17 Td
(- Summer \(June to August\): cool, many festivals and events, busy.) Tj
0 -17 Td
(- Spring \(March to May\): jacaranda flowers, green mountains.) Tj
0 -17 Td
(- Winter \(December to February\): cold at night, quiet, good for hiking.) Tj
0 -17 Td
(- Rainy days: be careful driving on mountain roads.) Tj
